# GoDark Go SDK -- workspace environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` at this repository root (git-ignored). The in-repo
# examples under `examples/` resolve keys from the **process environment
# first**, then from `.env` only (see `examples/internal/envloader`).
# `.env.example` is a template -- it is not read at runtime.
#
# Run `go run ./examples/<name>` from this directory so the working
# directory matches these paths.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API credentials (used when builder omits APIKey / APIKeyID+APISecret)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GODARK_API_KEY_ID=
# GODARK_API_SECRET=

# Opaque key (e.g. local edges):
# GODARK_API_KEY=test-key-1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WebSocket endpoint and user fallback (used when builder omits BaseURL / UserUUID)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GODARK_EDGE_URL=wss://api.godark-dex.com
# GODARK_EDGE_URL=ws://127.0.0.1:4000

# GODARK_USER_UUID=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

# Non-public CA on wss:// (dev only):
# GODARK_TLS_SKIP_VERIFY=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REST / HTTP API base (for GodarkRestClient; not used by GodarkClient/MarketDataClient)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GODARK_REST_URL=https://api.godark-dex.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live / integration-style runs (not used by default CI here)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GDX_LIVE_EDGE=1

# GDX_USE_DOCS_WIRE=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Legacy GDX_* aliases -- same meanings as corresponding GODARK_* when unset
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GDX_API_KEY_ID=
# GDX_API_SECRET=
# GDX_API_KEY=
# GDX_EDGE_URL=
# GDX_USER_UUID=
# GDX_REST_URL=
# GDX_TLS_SKIP_VERIFY=1
